WEBVTT

00:05.337 --> 00:08.004
[The following program is a true story.]

00:08.212 --> 00:11.726
[At least some of it is... untrue.]

00:12.436 --> 00:14.619
[True.]

00:17.539 --> 00:21.455
[6PM - New Year's Eve]

00:28.123 --> 00:29.373
Sloppy...

00:30.081 --> 00:32.103
What a sloppy way to kill someone.

00:32.873 --> 00:34.657
This leaves so much DNA evidence behind.

00:34.846 --> 00:36.137
As I cop, I could catch them all.

00:36.162 --> 00:36.931
Forget about it.

00:36.956 --> 00:38.556
A knife leaves a bloody mess!

00:38.581 --> 00:39.688
HELP! Is Long here?!

00:39.713 --> 00:42.610
Help me! My family needs help!

00:44.998 --> 00:46.309
A bloody mess!

01:22.914 --> 01:26.599
MISSING: EVE OF TET

01:27.952 --> 01:31.784
Episode 1: New Year's Eve

01:32.998 --> 01:34.684
Hey everyone!

01:34.709 --> 01:37.517
It's almost Noon! The market is closing soon!
[12PM - New Year's Eve]

01:37.542 --> 01:39.912
So you better hurry quickly to buy.

01:39.937 --> 01:42.274
Or else there will be no chickens left!

01:43.039 --> 01:47.190
This is your last chance to buy
Hoa's free-range chickens!

01:47.215 --> 01:49.509
She won't be selling
any chickens during Tet!

01:49.697 --> 01:51.959
Here is my sister, Mai.

01:51.984 --> 01:53.409
She's cleaning the chickens!

01:53.641 --> 01:56.994
A clean chicken is a tasty chicken!

01:57.019 --> 01:58.920
Hoa's chickens
are the cleanest in the market!

01:58.945 --> 02:01.676
You see how clean these chickens are!

02:01.701 --> 02:04.201
Not dirty like those chickens
in the next stall!

02:04.226 --> 02:07.101
If you order right now...

02:07.445 --> 02:09.868
Then my sister Mai will deliver
it to your doorstep!

02:09.893 --> 02:11.726
You brat! Your live-streaming
cost me a customer!

02:11.751 --> 02:14.709
Stream again and I'll boil you
alive and pluck you like a chicken!

02:14.734 --> 02:15.943
- Let go of her, Miss 6!
- WHAT?!

02:15.968 --> 02:17.413
She's just a kid!
How can you attack her like this?

02:17.445 --> 02:21.002
Her live-streaming made me lose a customer.
She cost me 400k VND, you know!

02:21.027 --> 02:22.493
I didn't say anything bad!

02:22.518 --> 02:25.002
I only said that our chickens
were the cleanest!

02:25.027 --> 02:26.485
- Still talking?!
- Screw you!

02:26.510 --> 02:27.469
You bitch!

02:27.494 --> 02:29.288
Touch my daughter again
and I'll cut you!

02:29.313 --> 02:31.417
Look! See how she is twisting
things around!

02:31.442 --> 02:33.267
Her daughter live-streams nonsense...

02:33.292 --> 02:36.126
Calling me this and that
and made me lost a customer.

02:36.172 --> 02:39.271
I swear! One of these days
you're going to get yours!

02:39.296 --> 02:40.561
Stand still, if you're so tough!

02:40.586 --> 02:41.309
Stand still!

02:41.334 --> 02:42.267
Say that again!

02:42.292 --> 02:43.251
I will cut you up!

02:43.706 --> 02:44.665
Screw you!

02:47.333 --> 02:49.583
I told you not to point your
camera at Miss 6!

02:49.608 --> 02:53.017
I just wanted to livestream to help
us sell more chickens.

02:53.042 --> 02:54.451
Who watches your livestream?

02:54.594 --> 02:56.381
Help me clean and close up!

02:56.406 --> 02:57.691
It's already getting late.

02:57.763 --> 02:59.047
We still need to close up.

02:59.072 --> 03:00.363
- Yes, mom.
- Here...

03:00.904 --> 03:02.349
Where have you been all morning?

03:03.250 --> 03:04.680
Lots to do before Tet.

03:05.359 --> 03:08.297
Just worry about making money.
Why waste time fighting with that bitch?

03:15.751 --> 03:16.376
Mom.

03:18.555 --> 03:20.636
- What we discussed yesterday...
- Save it!

03:20.899 --> 03:21.940
We'll talk about that after Tet.

03:32.482 --> 03:35.525
I'm out of chickens.
I told you that I don't have any left!

03:35.550 --> 03:37.389
Alright? I don't have it,
so stop demanding!

03:40.583 --> 03:41.554
What are you looking at?

03:44.446 --> 03:45.737
I told you that I don't have any!

03:46.844 --> 03:49.171
Oh! It's you, Auntie!
You want chicken innards?

03:49.391 --> 03:50.804
Yes, we have some. How many...

03:52.153 --> 03:54.528
Damn, that dog. He hung up on me...

03:56.667 --> 03:57.584
[Auntie...?]

03:57.876 --> 03:59.126
[He...?]

03:59.914 --> 04:00.914
I need to run an errand.

04:01.533 --> 04:03.367
The two of you help close up shop.

04:03.852 --> 04:05.982
Where the hell is your father?
Why isn't he here to help out?

04:06.153 --> 04:08.320
Our ancestors will be upset
if we're late to make the offering.

04:08.937 --> 04:10.136
He infuriates me!

04:10.520 --> 04:11.821
So damn useless!

04:12.211 --> 04:13.500
You always curse him.

04:14.016 --> 04:15.270
And why shouldn't I?

04:15.295 --> 04:18.612
What's he good for? All he ever does
is get drunk everyday!

04:18.637 --> 04:19.910
He's useless. What else?

04:20.451 --> 04:21.642
Infuriating.

04:21.667 --> 04:22.646
Damn.

04:58.826 --> 04:59.694
Hello?

04:59.955 --> 05:01.559
Hi Dad. Where are you?

05:01.584 --> 05:03.575
I'm on my way to you.

05:03.600 --> 05:05.619
Dad, Mom is on the rampage today.

05:05.644 --> 05:07.032
I asked but she wouldn't tell me.

05:07.057 --> 05:08.211
That's your Mom.

05:08.236 --> 05:11.690
She's secretive as a cat with its poop!
Just let her rant. Don't mind her.

05:12.167 --> 05:13.476
But she's different this time.

05:13.501 --> 05:15.726
Like she's sitting on a hill of fire ants!

05:15.751 --> 05:16.736
Nonsense!

05:16.761 --> 05:20.453
If anything, she's the one putting ants
down someone's pants. Don't worry!

05:21.849 --> 05:23.363
Move the fuck out of the way!

05:24.067 --> 05:25.468
Let me at him!

05:32.602 --> 05:34.234
Dad! What happened?

05:34.297 --> 05:36.140
- God! I'm dead...
- Dad, what's wrong? What happened?

05:36.165 --> 05:37.778
- Dad!
- I'm so dead...

05:37.819 --> 05:38.679
Shit!

05:38.751 --> 05:39.892
What's going on, Dad?

05:40.407 --> 05:42.996
I'm okay... Let me call you back!

05:43.021 --> 05:44.036
It's Vinh.

05:45.407 --> 05:46.777
Dad! Hello?

05:47.001 --> 05:47.804
Dad!

05:55.017 --> 05:56.578
Oh god! My chicken coops!

05:56.603 --> 06:00.005
- The coops. My wife is going to kill me!
- Fuck! He values chicken cages over a human life!

06:00.399 --> 06:01.166
Let go!

06:01.486 --> 06:03.408
- Stop crying over the cages!
- Don't...

06:03.433 --> 06:04.544
Pay for the damage to my bike!

06:04.569 --> 06:05.785
I don't have any money on me.

06:06.115 --> 06:10.412
Follow me to the market and I'll
ask my daughter for money to pay you.

06:10.437 --> 06:12.437
- Done. Let's go!
- No! Don't ask her daughter...

06:12.462 --> 06:14.233
- We're already late to pick up the goods.
- Let go!

06:14.258 --> 06:14.934
Stop!

06:15.308 --> 06:17.587
The chicken gods
are watching over you today!

06:23.677 --> 06:26.080
You're crazy. Let's go!

06:36.026 --> 06:37.120
I'm so dead.

06:45.805 --> 06:47.768
You're going too slow.

06:47.793 --> 06:51.034
I've made a whole bunch,
while you've made...

06:51.143 --> 06:52.971
Only two!

06:53.049 --> 06:54.233
Don't rush.

06:54.375 --> 06:56.124
My hands are not as small as yours.

06:57.166 --> 07:01.101
Just remember that the slower you work
the less money we make.

07:01.126 --> 07:02.051
What are you doing?

07:02.302 --> 07:03.679
I'm taking them off.

07:03.704 --> 07:06.913
If I use these two hair ties,
then I lose 20k profit.

07:07.591 --> 07:09.211
Yes, boss.

07:09.680 --> 07:10.346
Mai!

07:10.437 --> 07:11.062
Yes?

07:11.440 --> 07:14.596
I don't bear grudges like your Mother.
There's a client calling for you!

07:14.626 --> 07:15.251
Yes!

07:16.773 --> 07:18.744
Who doesn't want money?

07:18.804 --> 07:24.237
But I have never stolen a customer
from anyone else in my life!

07:24.262 --> 07:27.143
- What happened to your leg?
- Oh, sit down, will ya!

07:27.168 --> 07:28.642
- Yes, we have.
- He's fine!

07:28.667 --> 07:30.790
He's a long time pro!

07:30.815 --> 07:33.370
- He's always injuring himself!
- Help me clean up. Hurry, honey.

07:33.395 --> 07:34.104
Yes.

07:34.129 --> 07:34.909
Miss 6!

07:34.934 --> 07:36.345
Here's your phone. Thank you!

07:36.370 --> 07:39.253
No thanks. Just give me 10% commission!

07:40.799 --> 07:43.093
Hey... What happened to you earlier?

07:43.118 --> 07:43.868
It's nothing.

07:44.368 --> 07:46.273
Did someone just ordered chickens?

07:46.298 --> 07:47.369
More than a dozen!

07:47.394 --> 07:50.290
The destination is very far, but they
said that they would pay extra.

07:50.315 --> 07:51.291
Hold this for me.

07:52.313 --> 07:53.809
Give me the address. I'll deliver them.

07:53.834 --> 07:55.626
Forget it! Your leg is injured.

07:55.651 --> 07:57.151
I can do it. It'll be faster.

07:57.571 --> 07:58.404
Plus...

07:58.969 --> 08:00.554
On the way back, I can buy
some snake wine for you.

08:00.579 --> 08:01.614
Okay.

08:02.126 --> 08:03.182
Hey.

08:03.275 --> 08:05.319
Hey, you need to pay me for that!

08:05.359 --> 08:07.372
Pay what? Come help me and Dad!

08:07.397 --> 08:09.222
Pay money. That's what!

08:09.247 --> 08:10.857
If we're late, Mom will chew our heads off!

08:11.193 --> 08:12.591
I know...

08:24.341 --> 08:27.829
One little duck spreads its two wings

08:27.854 --> 08:31.114
He calls out, Quack-quack-quack!
Quack-quack-quack!

08:31.139 --> 08:34.388
Gets to the pond and he bop-bop-bops

08:34.413 --> 08:38.163
On the shore he will dry his wings

08:38.278 --> 08:39.816
Your hair is flying everywhere.

08:39.976 --> 08:41.508
Why didn't you tie it up?

08:41.682 --> 08:44.735
Why use a hair tie when I can sell it?

08:45.188 --> 08:45.887
Here!

08:45.915 --> 08:46.930
Tie it up!

08:47.141 --> 08:48.604
Don't let your hair get in my face!

08:48.629 --> 08:52.393
I'm just gonna put this away
and sell it later to make some money!

08:52.674 --> 08:53.834
Tie it!

08:53.869 --> 08:55.153
You're no fun.

08:55.178 --> 08:56.344
Mai!

08:57.036 --> 08:59.474
There's a party at the border later.

08:59.641 --> 09:00.951
Wanna go? I'll drive.

09:00.976 --> 09:05.051
My sister wouldn't go anywhere with you.
You've got a dirty mind!

09:05.084 --> 09:07.896
Oh yeah. Dirty is my middle name!

09:08.002 --> 09:09.469
I could teach you.

09:09.494 --> 09:12.351
This guy.
You don't think I can kick your ass?

09:12.376 --> 09:14.572
Call me after your delivery!

09:14.597 --> 09:17.655
Who are you kissing, you punk?
Mister, go punch his lights out!

09:17.680 --> 09:20.490
- You little punk!
- I'm gonna kill you!

09:20.734 --> 09:22.568
Hey, don't be like that!

09:25.305 --> 09:27.435
You like Phao, don't you?

09:27.460 --> 09:28.653
Who says?

09:29.025 --> 09:31.366
I saw the way that you were looking at him.

09:31.435 --> 09:33.130
That's enough, big sis!

09:33.155 --> 09:35.205
- You're lying.
- We're home!

09:36.588 --> 09:39.515
Hey! How come Mom hasn't
set things up yet?

09:40.042 --> 09:41.848
So then go help her do it!

09:44.044 --> 09:46.517
Hey, you have to pay 10k for that!

09:46.542 --> 09:47.304
Nope.

09:47.329 --> 09:51.019
Then I'm telling Mom.
I'm not joking around!

09:51.042 --> 09:52.267
I'll pay you later when I'm back.

09:52.292 --> 09:54.185
When is later?

09:54.435 --> 09:56.934
Remember to pay me 10k, Mai!

10:02.501 --> 10:05.256
[2PM - New Year's Eve]

10:05.281 --> 10:08.512
[5:30PM - New Year's Eve]

10:11.127 --> 10:14.299
The number you have dialed
is not in service.

10:14.324 --> 10:16.880
Please try again later.

10:35.328 --> 10:38.562
The number you have dialed
is not in service.

10:38.716 --> 10:41.161
Please try again later.

10:52.448 --> 10:53.214
Vinh!

10:53.531 --> 10:54.197
Vinh!

10:56.299 --> 10:56.924
Vinh!

10:58.463 --> 10:59.514
Vinh, where is Mai?

10:59.539 --> 11:00.260
Shit!

11:00.285 --> 11:01.476
- What are you doing?
- I'm sorry...

11:01.501 --> 11:02.747
Huh? What the hell?

11:02.772 --> 11:05.184
You told me to prepare some chickens
for a customer.

11:05.209 --> 11:07.335
How can you worry about that
when our daughter has gone missing?

11:08.042 --> 11:09.726
Missing? She went to deliver...

11:09.751 --> 11:12.587
I swear if you say that she went to deliver
chickens one more time, I'll smack you!

11:13.112 --> 11:14.421
Who did Mai go out with?

11:15.054 --> 11:16.111
I don't know.

11:17.122 --> 11:17.997
Where did she go?

11:19.492 --> 11:20.584
I don't know that either.

11:20.626 --> 11:23.283
Damn it! You're annoyingly stupid!

11:23.470 --> 11:25.010
How is it that you don't know anything?

11:25.446 --> 11:28.351
Um, Mom. It's because Dad wasn't there.

11:28.376 --> 11:29.609
So then who did Mai go out with?

11:29.634 --> 11:30.629
Um...

11:30.893 --> 11:34.455
The customer called Miss 6,
and she handed the phone to Mai.

11:34.480 --> 11:35.698
That bitch.

11:39.667 --> 11:40.334
6!

11:41.024 --> 11:42.030
Where's Mai?

11:42.273 --> 11:44.108
You handed her the phone,
so where did she go?

11:44.704 --> 11:46.059
You shut your damn mouth!

11:46.084 --> 11:47.559
You think I won't call the cops on you?

11:47.584 --> 11:49.627
My nephew is a cop! He'll hall your
ass to the station right now!

11:49.652 --> 11:50.484
You...

11:51.208 --> 11:52.735
Damn that bitch!

12:01.584 --> 12:03.410
Go get Long!

12:05.542 --> 12:07.501
[6PM - New Year's Eve]

12:09.684 --> 12:13.746
- Can I speak with...
- Have you located your daughter?

12:14.309 --> 12:16.142
No... She's gone missing.

12:16.167 --> 12:19.894
So while you were protecting your daughter
the attackers stabbed you, right?

12:19.919 --> 12:21.620
And then they stabbed your daughter, right?

12:21.880 --> 12:24.601
- Good god, no! My daughter is just...
- So then what do you call that?

12:24.626 --> 12:25.991
What's all over your shirt?

12:26.016 --> 12:29.314
Oh god, no! This is chicken blood.
I was preparing chickens for a customer.

12:29.339 --> 12:30.897
My daughter has gone missing.

12:30.969 --> 12:31.994
Take his statement.

12:32.019 --> 12:34.685
- My daughter... I just want to know...
- Slow down!

12:34.710 --> 12:38.384
- You'll get your turn. Just speak slowly.
- Name?

12:38.713 --> 12:40.088
Ha Quang Vinh.

12:40.113 --> 12:44.684
Your daughter's name. We're asking for
your daughter's name, not yours.

12:44.709 --> 12:45.376
Mai.

12:45.401 --> 12:46.767
First and last name.

12:46.792 --> 12:47.876
Her complete full name.

12:48.799 --> 12:50.377
- Ha Thi Mai.
- Age?

12:50.424 --> 12:52.688
- Twenty.
- How long has she been missing?

12:53.619 --> 12:54.517
From the market.

12:54.542 --> 12:55.930
How long has she been missing?

12:55.955 --> 13:00.559
We want to know how much time
has passed since she's been missing?

13:00.584 --> 13:01.465
Uh...

13:01.993 --> 13:03.345
Six hours!

13:03.370 --> 13:04.276
Six hours?

13:05.471 --> 13:07.884
I'm sorry, sir.
This is Lunar New Year's Eve.

13:07.909 --> 13:09.648
Can't you see we're extremely busy?

13:11.404 --> 13:13.062
We're swamped. What are you looking at?

13:13.087 --> 13:14.476
They're all out patrolling.

13:14.501 --> 13:15.726
It's New Year's Eve, sir!

13:15.751 --> 13:18.284
- Can I speak with...
- Listen to me. Just go on home.

13:18.309 --> 13:19.010
I'm looking for...

13:19.035 --> 13:21.409
She has to be missing
for at least 24 hours.

13:21.434 --> 13:23.767
- Especially tonight.
- We will make a special report after that.

13:23.792 --> 13:25.417
My god! I just want to speak with Long!

13:25.442 --> 13:27.725
- I'm still talking!
- I want my nephew Long!

13:27.750 --> 13:30.345
- I don't need to know which Long.
- Where can I find Long?

13:35.966 --> 13:39.074
If I had wanted you to go to the police,
then I would have said PO-LICE.

13:39.099 --> 13:40.183
Were you even listening?

13:41.055 --> 13:44.608
If you wanted me to go to his work place,
then we should have gone together.

13:44.633 --> 13:46.550
Then who would have
looked after Hanh? Huh?

13:48.039 --> 13:50.236
Mom wasn't home earlier.

14:04.915 --> 14:06.593
What? I was singing.

14:06.618 --> 14:09.517
Sure. Lucky you're a cop, not a singer.

14:09.542 --> 14:11.181
If you were a singer, we'd be lost.

14:11.206 --> 14:12.363
What do you mean, lost?

14:12.388 --> 14:16.226
Don't you know that music can help
develop an infant's brain?

14:16.251 --> 14:17.840
Sure. Just keep on singing.

14:17.865 --> 14:20.392
Don't be surprise
if our child comes out deaf.

14:20.417 --> 14:21.842
Hey! Don't jinx us!

14:21.867 --> 14:22.888
Long!

14:22.913 --> 14:24.780
Long! Mai has gone missing.

14:24.805 --> 14:25.958
Open the door, son!

14:25.983 --> 14:26.636
Long!

14:29.517 --> 14:32.095
Okay. I know. Just sit down
and hear me out.

14:32.120 --> 14:32.979
That cops have already told you that

14:33.004 --> 14:35.485
she needs to have been missing
for 24hrs in order for it to be official.

14:35.510 --> 14:37.071
There's nothing that I can do.

14:37.096 --> 14:38.244
Why not?

14:38.528 --> 14:39.959
You're not just a cop.

14:39.984 --> 14:42.709
You're her cousin. You have to do
everything in your power to save her.

14:42.877 --> 14:44.487
Save her from what, Auntie?

14:44.512 --> 14:46.715
We still don't know what has happened.

14:46.740 --> 14:48.122
Or where she could be.

14:48.147 --> 14:48.730
I know!

14:48.820 --> 14:50.246
I'm certain that 6 is behind this!

14:50.748 --> 14:53.231
She's trying to get back at me
for chasing her with a cleaver!

14:56.614 --> 14:59.517
You mean, you expect me to arrest 6?
I can't do that!

14:59.542 --> 15:00.517
Why not?

15:00.542 --> 15:02.267
You are a cop. Not just Mai's cousin!

15:02.292 --> 15:03.426
You can do anything!

15:05.584 --> 15:06.307
Hey!

15:06.477 --> 15:08.608
Take your problems elsewhere!

15:08.633 --> 15:09.444
It's the beginning of the year.

15:09.469 --> 15:11.655
I don't want her face jinxing the New Year!

15:11.792 --> 15:12.459
Long!

15:12.533 --> 15:15.190
You're a cop. You're going to let her
talk to your Aunt this way?

15:16.122 --> 15:18.084
But Miss 6 hasn't broken any laws.

15:18.126 --> 15:19.182
That's right!

15:19.821 --> 15:21.245
You're not just a cop.

15:21.270 --> 15:23.476
I raised you as if you were my own blood!

15:23.501 --> 15:25.042
Is this how you repay me?

15:28.709 --> 15:29.376
Miss 6.

15:29.885 --> 15:33.392
Is there any information that you can
tell me about the customer who called?

15:33.417 --> 15:35.644
He called me from a burner phone.
How would I know anything?

15:35.669 --> 15:40.330
I just wanted to do a good deed for Vinh.
They wanted to buy 15 chickens!

15:41.419 --> 15:45.548
I know that your whole family
is worried about Mai.

15:45.609 --> 15:48.655
But this whole situation
has nothing to do with me.

15:48.680 --> 15:49.976
Is that true?

15:50.901 --> 15:52.252
Thank you, Miss 6.

15:54.501 --> 15:55.334
Damn...

15:55.782 --> 15:56.986
You're truly useless!

16:02.229 --> 16:03.353
Sorry, Miss 6.

16:06.876 --> 16:09.231
Mom. There is someone we can ask.

16:09.317 --> 16:10.156
Who?

16:10.312 --> 16:12.726
He was teasing Mai earlier.

16:13.348 --> 16:14.227
Who?

16:14.510 --> 16:16.784
Maybe Mai went with him.

16:16.809 --> 16:17.804
I asked you who?

16:17.829 --> 16:19.280
Come on, Mother.

16:19.305 --> 16:21.514
It's not Hanh's fault Mai is missing.
Why are you yelling at her?

16:21.539 --> 16:23.226
She said that she knows who Mai is with!

16:23.251 --> 16:24.084
Who is it?

16:28.076 --> 16:29.056
I'm sorry.

16:31.182 --> 16:32.174
Phao.

16:33.251 --> 16:34.852
Mai...!

16:35.010 --> 16:37.527
There's a party at the border later.

16:37.724 --> 16:39.008
Wanna go? I'll drive.

16:39.033 --> 16:43.070
Mai wouldn't go anywhere with you.
You've got a dirty mind!

16:43.095 --> 16:45.846
Dirty is my middle name!

16:45.871 --> 16:47.718
Want me to teach you?

16:47.812 --> 16:49.672
She and I used to make out all the time.

16:49.697 --> 16:51.998
All the time?
We were only in grade school then.

16:52.023 --> 16:53.726
I barely kissed you on the cheek!

16:53.751 --> 16:54.900
Barely?

16:54.925 --> 16:57.986
Then you have no idea about your
power of seduction, Mai.

16:58.011 --> 16:59.719
You dare kiss my sister?

16:59.744 --> 17:02.442
- No such thing.
- We've done a lot more than that!

17:02.467 --> 17:03.884
Let's go! I'll drive you!

17:03.909 --> 17:05.502
We can make out for old time's sake.

17:05.542 --> 17:07.067
Aren't you scared that
Hong will get jealous?

17:07.092 --> 17:08.559
I'm just having fun with her.

17:08.584 --> 17:10.354
Hong already has a husband.

17:10.813 --> 17:13.402
She's not a maiden like you.

17:13.667 --> 17:14.468
Phao!

17:14.493 --> 17:15.410
Where's my wife?

17:15.435 --> 17:19.559
There! Speak of the devil and he
comes to get you!

17:19.584 --> 17:22.084
- I'm gonna get you!
- You're gonna get yours!

17:22.109 --> 17:24.526
This guy. You don't think I can
kick your ass?

17:24.551 --> 17:26.237
Can me after your delivery!

17:26.262 --> 17:29.851
Who are you kissing, you punk?
Mister, go punch his lights out!

17:29.876 --> 17:30.735
You dog!

17:30.760 --> 17:31.469
Screw you!

17:31.494 --> 17:33.463
You little punk!

17:36.450 --> 17:37.783
[11:45PM - NEW YEAR'S EVE]

17:47.937 --> 17:48.520
Phao!

17:48.545 --> 17:50.359
You dog? Where are you?
Come out!

17:50.384 --> 17:51.422
Oh shit.

17:51.447 --> 17:53.724
- PHAO!
- What's all the fuss?

17:53.749 --> 17:54.916
I just laid down to close my eyes...

17:54.941 --> 17:56.369
Don't make a sound!

17:56.394 --> 17:58.233
Where is Phao? Bring him out now!

17:58.258 --> 17:59.359
Auntie, listen to me.

17:59.873 --> 18:01.652
- Auntie, calm down.
- Move out of the way!

18:01.963 --> 18:03.476
Has my son done something wrong again?

18:03.501 --> 18:05.127
- Is he home?
- Uh. Yes.

18:05.152 --> 18:06.808
Where would he be on New Year's Eve?

18:06.833 --> 18:08.720
He seduced my daughter, now where is he?

18:08.745 --> 18:10.726
- He's in the back. You can check...
- Who's there?

18:10.751 --> 18:11.626
Where is he?

18:12.118 --> 18:12.959
Stop! You running?

18:13.349 --> 18:14.320
Stop!

18:19.599 --> 18:20.374
Stop!

18:21.292 --> 18:22.249
Stay where you are!

18:25.135 --> 18:25.927
Where's Mai?

18:26.122 --> 18:26.863
Mai?

18:26.888 --> 18:28.726
You dog! Where's my daughter?

18:28.751 --> 18:29.483
Your daughter?

18:30.406 --> 18:33.471
- Where's my daughter?
- I swear, I haven't seen Mai!

18:34.437 --> 18:35.479
My daughter's in there, right?

18:35.626 --> 18:37.459
- Right?
- It's just a cat!

18:37.501 --> 18:38.126
Mai!

18:38.184 --> 18:39.310
There's no one there!

18:39.416 --> 18:40.941
- It's just a cat!
- Mai!

18:42.562 --> 18:43.646
Mai!

18:53.852 --> 18:54.775
Mai?

18:58.482 --> 18:59.364
Mai!

18:59.557 --> 19:00.754
Are you here, Mai?

19:01.185 --> 19:02.020
Mai!

19:12.419 --> 19:13.684
Where's my baby?

19:13.709 --> 19:16.244
I already told you.
Why would Mai be here?

19:16.366 --> 19:17.212
Dammit!

19:19.348 --> 19:20.811
Mai! Honey?

19:20.930 --> 19:22.069
Where have you been, Mai?

19:22.258 --> 19:23.549
Mai, is that you?

19:38.252 --> 19:40.438
You really don't know where she is?

19:45.398 --> 19:47.398
Honey, where is our daughter?

19:47.851 --> 19:51.754
Where is Mai? Where's our little girl?

19:53.084 --> 19:55.126
Where are you, Mai?

20:50.135 --> 20:51.985
Praise the lord, Buddha.

20:52.789 --> 20:54.838
We bow towards the heavens.

20:55.179 --> 20:57.205
We bow to our ancestors.

20:57.977 --> 21:00.685
Please protect my daughter...

21:00.854 --> 21:02.563
Ha Thi Mai.

21:03.667 --> 21:05.459
To overcome this hardship,

21:05.950 --> 21:07.908
And return safely to her family.

21:30.001 --> 21:32.834
[Happy New Year! Thanks for always trusting us.
We wish you a happy and prosperous year]

21:36.117 --> 21:38.382
- What's wrong?
- What happened, Mother?

21:44.876 --> 21:45.983
Dad...

22:08.709 --> 22:09.552
No.

22:11.278 --> 22:14.070
Our family can't welcome
the New Year this way.

22:22.341 --> 22:23.216
Hanh.

22:23.887 --> 22:25.317
Help me livestream.

22:29.145 --> 22:32.078
They always end the episode
just when it's getting good!

22:32.568 --> 22:34.124
You woke me up for this?

22:34.346 --> 22:35.263
Scared me to death!

22:37.187 --> 22:41.392
They end it this way, so that you can
stay tuned to see what happens next!

22:41.417 --> 22:44.699
- But I can see what's coming.
- Then stop watching!

22:45.982 --> 22:46.815
What now?

22:48.046 --> 22:50.016
My friends are telling
me to watch a livestream.

22:50.041 --> 22:51.314
Watch it at your desk!

22:52.911 --> 22:53.911
It's the chicken vendor!

22:55.353 --> 22:56.729
This is Mai.

22:56.754 --> 22:58.211
My daughter.

22:58.789 --> 23:00.502
She turned 20 this year.

23:01.471 --> 23:05.074
She's been missing for 12 hours,
and no one is willing to help.

23:05.103 --> 23:07.079
My family has informed the police.

23:07.124 --> 23:08.795
They ignored it because they were busy
with something else.

23:08.820 --> 23:10.266
I did not see that coming.

23:10.291 --> 23:11.423
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

23:11.459 --> 23:13.218
At 12:30pm...

23:13.791 --> 23:16.995
Someone called Miss 6 to order 15 chickens.

23:17.043 --> 23:18.787
- But she gave the order to Mai.
- Miss 6!

23:18.812 --> 23:19.861
She mentioned you.

23:19.886 --> 23:22.190
She told me that she doesn't know anything.

23:22.393 --> 23:23.989
But I'm 100% certain!

23:24.304 --> 23:25.135
6!

23:25.356 --> 23:27.837
You say you had nothing to do
with Mai going missing?

23:28.018 --> 23:29.857
I say you definitely do!

23:29.920 --> 23:31.610
My daughter is missing because of you!

23:31.635 --> 23:32.656
That bitch!

23:32.681 --> 23:34.640
What are you doing?
That was my phone!

23:34.724 --> 23:36.224
At 12:50pm...

23:36.695 --> 23:38.968
Phao accosted my daughter.

23:39.272 --> 23:42.142
Meanwhile everyone knows that he's
sleeping with Tam's wife, Hong!

23:42.167 --> 23:44.470
- You old hag!
- They're doing it in his filthy room...

23:44.495 --> 23:47.390
- at backyard of the house's miss 9.
- You don't like it?

23:47.415 --> 23:48.922
- It's disgusting!
- Oh god!

23:48.947 --> 23:50.001
That's your wife!

23:50.026 --> 23:52.946
He's banging Hong, but still
trying to seduce my daughter!

23:52.971 --> 23:53.763
Dog!

23:54.565 --> 23:56.385
At 1:30pm...

23:56.955 --> 23:59.145
We lost all contact with Mai.

23:59.196 --> 24:01.278
But the cops said that

24:01.303 --> 24:04.314
she has to be missing for
more than 24hrs in order to file a claim.

24:05.235 --> 24:06.660
I ask you all...

24:06.940 --> 24:09.476
If your child was missing for 24hrs,

24:09.501 --> 24:10.917
would you be able to sit still?

24:11.205 --> 24:14.073
How much can happen in just 24hrs?

24:14.714 --> 24:16.248
That's why I'm asking you...

24:16.575 --> 24:19.410
To contact me if you have any
information regarding Mai.

24:20.532 --> 24:23.091
This is a photo of Mai
on her graduation day.

24:23.805 --> 24:26.426
Her future rests in your hands.

24:27.424 --> 24:28.554
Mom...

24:28.579 --> 24:31.538
Hashtag, "Missing on New Year's Eve".

24:31.820 --> 24:34.414
Please remember to hashtag...

24:34.505 --> 24:36.372
Missing on New Year's Eve.

24:37.037 --> 24:39.370
If you have any information
regarding my daughter,

24:39.489 --> 24:42.730
Please let us know.
Our family is very grateful.

24:48.091 --> 24:49.713
What now, honey?

24:50.274 --> 24:53.238
Now we wait for the video to go viral!

24:53.263 --> 24:57.471
Look, Mom. 27 people have viewed it,
and 74 have shared it!

24:58.002 --> 25:00.554
- There's a lot more!
- Any news about Mai?

25:00.899 --> 25:02.065
Let me check.

25:08.883 --> 25:10.373
Then it's all for nothing.

25:11.313 --> 25:13.981
What good did any of that do?

25:14.834 --> 25:21.483
[Overlapping complaints.]

25:23.996 --> 25:28.629
[Overlapping complaints.]

25:29.626 --> 25:31.282
I'm coming to you at this hour,

25:31.667 --> 25:33.751
as Mai's cousin, not as a cop.

25:34.782 --> 25:37.407
My superior cannot stop you
from live-streaming.

25:37.834 --> 25:39.909
But he are also not happy...

25:39.934 --> 25:41.796
About you bad-mouthing the police online.

25:42.703 --> 25:44.781
Now there have been many complaints.

25:45.521 --> 25:48.813
Enough charges
to bring you into the station.

25:50.013 --> 25:51.629
But Mai is my cousin.

25:52.906 --> 25:54.561
So my superior has agreed...

25:54.586 --> 25:56.043
to grant you a missing person's claim,

25:56.068 --> 25:57.544
even though Mai has been missing
for less than 24 hours.

25:57.893 --> 25:59.603
You finally got what you wanted.

25:59.628 --> 26:00.941
I just need Uncle's signature.

26:00.966 --> 26:02.664
The police will circulate this report to
other stations across the provinces,

26:02.689 --> 26:03.618
from here to Saigon.

26:03.643 --> 26:06.897
They will also start an official
investigation to find Mai.

26:59.915 --> 27:01.075
Tonight...

27:01.680 --> 27:05.943
I'm back to thank everyone who
watched the livestream,

27:05.968 --> 27:07.669
and shared our viral clip.

27:08.997 --> 27:10.997
Because of your support,

27:11.435 --> 27:13.552
We were able to make an official claim.

27:13.888 --> 27:17.380
But it's still not enough, because my
daughter is still out there.

27:17.453 --> 27:18.586
What happened?

27:18.611 --> 27:21.385
You told me that you got her
to stop live-streaming.

27:22.031 --> 27:23.603
It's nearly 3am now.

27:23.628 --> 27:27.298
Which means that Mai has
been missing for 14 hours.

27:28.242 --> 27:29.075
As you all know...

27:29.100 --> 27:31.786
If she keeps live-streaming like this,
then you could get fired.

27:32.763 --> 27:34.554
She's probably just very worried about Mai.

27:34.579 --> 27:35.767
We are worried, too.

27:35.792 --> 27:37.070
But if she kept stirring up trouble,

27:37.095 --> 27:39.726
instead of letting the police work on it,
then you will get fired.

27:39.751 --> 27:41.319
Let me go over to talk with her.

27:41.344 --> 27:42.372
You're not going anywhere!

27:42.397 --> 27:44.934
You go over, and she'll ask you
to do this and that.

27:45.149 --> 27:45.937
Hey!

27:46.025 --> 27:48.050
The baby is coming next month!

27:48.075 --> 27:49.892
I can't have you getting fired!

27:49.917 --> 27:52.625
- But auntie and uncle needs me...
- She will use that to manipulate you!

27:53.646 --> 27:55.108
From this point on,

27:55.208 --> 27:56.041
with you aunt...

27:56.154 --> 27:58.218
You are just a cop.

27:58.435 --> 28:01.809
If she has any further issues, you tell her
to go to the police station to request.

28:01.834 --> 28:04.042
Although they have agreed
to search for her...

28:04.302 --> 28:06.493
They can only send out a handful of people.

28:06.822 --> 28:09.797
How can that compare to the
entire online community?

28:11.940 --> 28:13.310
That's why I'm asking you.

28:13.942 --> 28:16.512
As you go out to celebrate
the New Year with your family,

28:16.901 --> 28:19.554
Please look around you.

28:19.579 --> 28:21.971
If you see any trace of Mai,

28:22.091 --> 28:25.202
Please contact me,
or tell the police.

28:28.932 --> 28:30.438
Stay strong, honey.

28:31.626 --> 28:33.417
Mother is still looking for you.

28:35.042 --> 28:37.042
Everyone is still looking for you.

28:38.834 --> 28:41.126
The whole country is looking for you.

28:46.898 --> 28:48.619
Dad...

28:50.668 --> 28:52.162
Dad...

29:13.112 --> 29:14.553
Stay strong, honey.

29:15.584 --> 29:17.334
I will find you.

29:31.058 --> 29:34.266
MISSING: EVE OF TET
